{"id":"a98c4539b5ab9717","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-split-fibration-compat.md","title":"split-fibration — Compatibility alias","display":"split-fibration — Compatibility alias","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-split-fibration-compat","aliases":["16-df-split-fibration-compat","16-split-fibration"],"display":"split-fibration — Compatibility alias","depends_on":["[[16-df-split-fibration]]"],"source":"Definition 1.4.3(ii), pp. 49–50 (PDF 69–70)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-split-fibration-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-split-fibration-compat</span><span>16-split-fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"split-fibration — Compatibility alias"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 1.4.3(ii), pp. 49–50 (PDF 69–70)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为函子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 为候选提升选择。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(p)\\)</span> 由下文定义，只记录某个分裂存在的性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists\\kappa)\\ \\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SplitFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists\\kappa)\\ \\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>旧单参数入口不再将未绑定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 隐藏在单参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p)\\)</span> 中。需要具体严格重索引或严格保持提升的地方必须保留所选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>；只知道存在分裂不提供该结构。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为函子；$\\kappa$ 为候选提升选择。$\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$ 采用 [[16-df-split-fibration]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists\\kappa)\\ \\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa).","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1042,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-340","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-split-fibration-compat|split-fibration — Compatibility alias]]"}],"outgoing":["eb3d8d8bfc151af6"]}